{
  "technical_and_design_decisions": [
    "Reuse existing Spring Boot REST API conventions; platform-specific admin implementations expose a common AdminOperations interface so REST endpoints remain consistent across Lattice, YARN, and Cloud Foundry (U3).",
    "Kafka and Rabbit @Rule test fixtures are extracted into a dedicated Maven module/repo, published as versioned artifacts, and consumed via a test-scope dependency in the main project (U1, U2).",
    "Library registration extends the existing artifact registry by adding a 'library' type, allowing the stream definition parser to resolve include/exclude statements against the same registry (U4).",
    "Named channels are implemented as first-class elements in the stream DSL with explicit channel names that can be referenced in the deployer; streams without a source/sink are represented as channel-only definitions (U5).",
    "Stream name uniqueness is enforced at the service layer with a unique constraint on the underlying repository, returning a clear 4xx error code from the REST layer (U7).",
    "Kinesis source module is implemented as a new Spring Cloud Stream binder module that follows the same contract as the existing Kafka source (U8).",
    "StreamController API contract tests are added as a dedicated WebMvc/MockMvc test slice plus a contract test set integrated into the build (U6)."
  ],
  "assumptions": [
    "The target project is Spring Cloud Data Flow (SCDF) running on Spring Framework 6.x with Java 17+.",
    "A single experienced developer is implementing the increment; estimates are effort hours, not calendar duration.",
    "Existing build is Maven-based and an internal artifact repository (e.g., Artifactory/Nexus) is available for publishing the extracted test fixture artifacts (U1, U2).",
    "Admin abstraction skeleton already exists; U3 work focuses on Lattice/YARN/CF adapters and harmonizing the REST contract, not creating the abstraction from scratch.",
    "Kinesis AWS SDK is available on the classpath; U8 implements the SCDF module on top of the official AWS Kinesis client.",
    "JaCoCo and standard Spring Boot test infrastructure are already configured, so U6 is purely adding tests, not setting up tooling.",
    "U5 (named channels) is delivered as a feature flag-guarded capability to avoid breaking existing deployments.",
    "No production deployment or operational handover work is included; only development, unit/integration tests, and developer documentation."
  ],
  "activities": [
    {
      "activity_id": "A1",
      "activity_name": "Requirements analysis and overall design",
      "activity_description": "Review all eight user stories, identify cross-cutting concerns (e.g., consistent REST contracts, artifact registry changes), and produce a high-level design covering new modules, refactored components, and build/CI impacts.",
      "most_likely_effort": 16
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A2",
      "activity_name": "Extract Kafka @Rule test fixtures to separate repo (U1)",
      "activity_description": "Identify Kafka @Rule classes, create a new repository/Maven module, move the fixtures, publish to artifact repo, update SCDF build to depend on the new artifact, and verify affected tests still pass.",
      "most_likely_effort": 8
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A3",
      "activity_name": "Extract Rabbit @Rule test fixtures to separate repo (U2)",
      "activity_description": "Identify Rabbit @Rule classes, create a new repository/Maven module, move the fixtures, publish to artifact repo, update SCDF build to depend on the new artifact, and verify affected tests still pass.",
      "most_likely_effort": 8
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A4",
      "activity_name": "Platform admin abstraction and REST harmonization (U3)",
      "activity_description": "Refine/extend AdminOperations for Lattice, YARN, and Cloud Foundry adapters; ensure REST API responses are consistent across platforms; add unit and integration tests for each adapter; update REST controllers and DTOs.",
      "most_likely_effort": 48
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A5",
      "activity_name": "Register artifacts as libraries (U4)",
      "activity_description": "Extend artifact registry model to support a 'library' type; add REST endpoints to register/manage libraries; update stream definition parser to resolve include/exclude statements against registered libraries; add tests.",
      "most_likely_effort": 24
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A6",
      "activity_name": "Named channels support (U5)",
      "activity_description": "Extend stream DSL to allow defining named channels without a source or sink; update parser, deployer, and runtime configuration to materialize channels; add feature flag and tests for channel-only streams.",
      "most_likely_effort": 32
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A7",
      "activity_name": "StreamController test coverage (U6)",
      "activity_description": "Add WebMvc/MockMvc unit tests and contract tests for all StreamController endpoints; integrate coverage reporting and build-time API contract verification.",
      "most_likely_effort": 16
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A8",
      "activity_name": "Prevent duplicate stream names (U7)",
      "activity_description": "Add a unique constraint/validation in the stream repository and service layer; map violations to a clear REST error response; add unit and integration tests for the duplicate-name scenario.",
      "most_likely_effort": 12
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A9",
      "activity_name": "Implement Kinesis source module (U8)",
      "activity_description": "Create a new Spring Cloud Stream binder module for Kinesis usable as a source; implement consumer configuration, error handling, and tests; document usage.",
      "most_likely_effort": 24
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A10",
      "activity_name": "Integration testing across features",
      "activity_description": "Run end-to-end tests covering stream creation/lookup (U7), library-based stream composition (U4), named-channel deployment (U5), Kinesis source ingestion (U8), and admin REST behavior across platforms (U3).",
      "most_likely_effort": 24
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A11",
      "activity_name": "Developer documentation",
      "activity_description": "Update reference docs and migration notes for the new repos (U1, U2), multi-platform admin (U3), libraries (U4), named channels (U5), Kinesis source (U8), and the StreamController contract (U6).",
      "most_likely_effort": 16
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A12",
      "activity_name": "Build, CI, and release configuration",
      "activity_description": "Update Maven modules, CI pipelines, and release scripts to publish the new test-fixture artifacts and to build/package the Kinesis module and any new admin adapters.",
      "most_likely_effort": 8
    }
  ],
  "reported_total": {
    "most_likely_effort": 236
  }
}
```

